5G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"American (Traditional), Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"kdqoDMuvyNedsouc1i33vQ","name":"Araña Taqueria y Cantina","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"TMBbCDQG6bENJoQSST0XiA","name":"Brigtsen's Restaurant","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"BjeHLwKOlHyV6DJgmZxAjA","review_id":"7HY50gT8PunFmotK8hEYoA","date":"2017-05-15T22:27:10","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9439061880111694,"text_excerpt":"What a great place! I discovered this place through Yelp. It's tiny and easy to miss so be on the lookout for it. We had to wait about 20 minutes for a table for breakfast on a weekday but it was well worth it. Our host and server (both young guys) were super friendly and accommodating. The food was amazing. I got their special which was Captain Crunch French toast. Delicious. My friends got the eggs Benedict and breakfast sandwich with home fries. I tried some and they all tasted great. The orange juice was also great. Highly recommend this place."},{"business_id":"BjeHLwKOlHyV6DJgmZxAjA","review_id":"eUVh69an4tnqkfZt83drbw","date":"2019-02-09T17:56:26","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9416232705116272,"text_excerpt":"Wow, what a find. We've walked past this place 50 times and just never considered it because we usually have other breakfast places on the list. I looked at Yelp reviews early one morning, and thank God it was early, because this little shotgun room (maybe ten tables) filled right after us and by the time we left, there was a queue around the block. I had the Cochon Eggs Benedict (with an upsell of a blob of crab), and it was sublime. Rich and creamy and the pork was deliciously smoked. The husband had the Eggs Ranchero (with an upsell of andouille) and was transported. I don't think he spoke until he asked for the check. I had a bite and it was super spicy and so freaking good. The staff..."},{"business_id":"BjeHLwKOlHyV6DJgmZxAjA","review_id":"ff-9FCFnR2ULO_MbLb5MZg","date":"2018-05-31T20:36:34","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9371459484100342,"text_excerpt":"Oh my sweet lawd! We were in NOLA for 7 days. We ate brunch here twice in that time. Sunday and Thursday. Sunday there was a line at the door, so we waited and chatted with people in line. The guy and two girls ahead of us were on their third trip in 5 days, so we knew we were in the right place. There are approximately 9 tables inside, and the wait is worth it. Trevor, our server for both visits, is a doll. He's funny, attentive, drinks stayed full, and our order was correct each visit. My only thing was his little short ass couldn't reach the ketchup, so I had to give him a hard time about that. I got the French Toast Monte Cristo. It's good, but I personally, would add some kind of fru..."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"BjeHLwKOlHyV6DJgmZxAjA","photo_id":"tb7SrMirPjew5wB7VY8HrA","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/tb7SrMirPjew5wB7VY8HrA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.863455593585968},{"business_id":"BjeHLwKOlHyV6DJgmZxAjA","photo_id":"StLgbT9HhDcLpRnmnQ6fLA","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/StLgbT9HhDcLpRnmnQ6fLA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8595855236053467},{"business_id":"BjeHLwKOlHyV6DJgmZxAjA","photo_id":"D6gYsXWc3Mw3L68EEkym_w","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/D6gY